{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"d72a02e703885d101f6b0e49e20f0e9d2b41c75f8cf5660f5a4f311f47ff0d62","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"d64daff63a7c293e7e22fbe23398d214e4fbc88d6bc886c5f88c317f024ed0ee","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"grids.lua@624a6732:115-116 原文只说 \"It is made for exploration\"，译文「它只是用来探索异度空间的」凭空添加了「异度空间」，还加了「只是」，把目的地限定成了原文没有的内容。末句 \"might not be near your arrival zone\" 的意思是返程门可能离你到达的区域不近，译作「可能该传送门不在你所传送的位置」，丢了 near／zone 的含义，说法也不通顺。"},{"revision_key":"48c3f899975f99a0125b01e9c76e98b44053d66e0bd9136534385f73850205f1","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"baa3d12b9aad8f5c62bb10cdbde55193908cbfbdb5cb7e91475e1c466af1e730","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"3075873708d7ad445f7dca6aab3b5feb9bbeda5fd33e2ffe95ae7cafab64312f","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"07c8b41ef059881216cbea46e8cb9665a7b92e22949afb826cc6574010b03002","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"agility.lua@624a6732:279-281 在 self:hasArcheryWeapon() 为假时输出此句，原文是 \"without a bow or sling\"，并点名 Rapid Fire。译文「你需要装备投石索才能使用这个技能！」漏掉了弓，误导玩家以为只能用投石索，还把技能名换成了「这个技能」。应译为未装备弓或投石索时无法使用该技能（Rapid Fire）。"},{"revision_key":"2d5fd209cb78540ff89b388c36ccfde8a4fb58195ea00512f66046c920c9d62e","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"2f0162776a30bb35cc3d54d06e6fc4010ef07e6792f46a559259b66f86e58cf3","verdict":"OK"}]}